<title>CANADA: Canadian industry forms wheat protein group - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian industry forms wheat protein group - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's grain industry formed a consultative committee on wheat protein quality and quantity, a Canadian Wheat Board official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a bridge between the research and market communities and the farming community,&quot; CWB market development manager Earl Geddes said.</p>
<p>The Prairie Protein Action Committee aims to meet customer demands on wheat protein quality and quantity, provide farmers with market and research information and track research programs.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
